13
00:03:19,017 --> 00:03:24,017
After being separated from his crew, Luffy set out to rescue his captured brother Ace.

14
00:03:24,017 --> 00:03:28,017
To do so, he snuck into the government prison Impel Down,

15
00:03:28,017 --> 00:03:31,017
forming an unlikely alliance with Buggy the Cloud.

16
00:03:31,017 --> 00:03:35,017
Luffy heads to the second level of the prison, the floor of Wild Beast from Hell.

17
00:03:35,017 --> 00:03:39,017
There he encounters Mr. Three, a former Baroque works agent,

18
00:03:39,017 --> 00:03:43,017
